ITA-5.14.6 mṛdbhakṣaṇajanya/ kṛmijapāṇḍurogaḥ मृद्भक्षणजन्य/ कृमिजपाण्डुरोगः
Anaemic syndrome due to pica or dirt-eating
A disorder characterized by some or all the following signs and symptoms: loss of strength; loss of agni; loss of normal body colour; swelling of malar region; supraorbital swelling; swelling of eyebrows; pedal oedema; periumbilical oedema; oedema of penis; worm infestation in abdomen; diarrhoea/ altered stools; worms in faecal matter; oedema of face; blood-mixed faecal matter; mucus-mixed faecal matter;
